 /w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/60px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Life Drain\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp/30px-Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5b/Generic_Debuff_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Life_Drain_(Condition)\" title=\"Life Drain (Condition)\">Life Drain</a></strong><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-lightmode-drop-shadow\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/38px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/50px-Duration_Icons.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Duration Icons.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png/25px-Duration_Icons.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/6/6a/Duration_Icons.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span> Duration: Until <a href=\"/wiki/Long_rest\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Long rest\">Long rest</a></p><p><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png 1.5x\"><img alt=\"CON Save (DC&nbsp;14)\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png/25px-Saving_Throw_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/e/e7/Saving_Throw_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Constitution\" title=\"Constitution\">CON</a> <a href=\"/wiki/Saving_throws\" title=\"Saving throws\">Save</a> (<a href=\"/wiki/DC\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"DC\">DC</a>&nbsp;14)</p>\n<div>\n<p>Hit point maximum reduced by 2d8. Creature will die if its hit point maximum is reduced to 0.\n</p>\n</div>\n </div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:\n<a href=\"/wiki/Shadow\" title=\"Shadow\">Shadow</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Mummy\" title=\"Mummy\">Mummy</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Daddy\" title=\"Daddy\">Daddy</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Wraith\" title=\"Wraith\">Wraith</a>\n</p>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715105302\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.073 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.080 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 2922/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 48182/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 16989/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 26/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 35/1000\nLua time usage: 0.015/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1298020/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n124.89%   85.031     45 Template:Trim\n100.00%   68.083      1 Template:Feature_page\n100.00%   68.083      1 -total\n 24.27%   16.522      6 Template:Icon_text\n 19.48%   13.261      1 Template:Condition\n 18.76%   12.770      3 Template:Icon_link\n 17.76%   12.090      1 Template:Feature_page/technical_section\n 15.42%   10.497      1 Template:DamageText\n 14.07%    9.581      1 Template:Damage_type\n 12.67%    8.627      6 Template:Ifempty\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:25420-0!canonical and timestamp 20260715105302 and revision id 340898. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}